| Severity | Examples |
|----------|----------|
| Critical | Sandbox escape, arbitrary code execution, policy bypass |
| High | Unauthorized filesystem access, audit bypass, authentication bypass |
| Medium | Resource limit bypass, deterministic replay issues |
